  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The relative «chi» with a singular verb",
     "texto": [
      "«**Chi** cerca trova» (whoever seeks finds); «Premio **chi** merita» (a prize to whoever deserves it). The verb agrees strictly in the third person singular, even though the meaning covers a group of people."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The neuter relative «quanto»",
     "texto": [
      "«Farò **quanto** è in mio potere» (I will do everything in my power); «Per **quanto** ne so, la riunione è confermata» (as far as I know, the meeting is confirmed). In the plural, **quanti / quante** takes a collective personal meaning: «Ringrazio **quanti** hanno collaborato» (I thank all who have helped)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Double relative",
